        "32x32": "https://metricell.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/universal_avatar/view/type/project/avatar/10400?size=medium"
      }
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A user should be able to inspect the Surveyor add-layer dialog and cancel without adding a layer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Environment: https://o2intelligence-v4-dev.metricell.com/launcher. Start from the launcher using existing authorised access. Check visible in-session behaviour only; do not edit saved records or change account permissions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "orderedList",
          "attrs": {
            "order": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In the settled GIS workspace, record the visible current Map layers list or empty-layer state. Selecting Add layer for Surveyor opens its configuration dialog with identifiable controls and a Cancel action."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Selecting Cancel closes that dialog and returns to the GIS map. The Map layers list retains its recorded entries or empty state, and no new Surveyor layer is added."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Opening the Surveyor add-layer dialog again displays the configuration controls and Cancel action, and cancelling again returns to the map without adding a layer."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Scope: use Cancel, never the dialog's confirmation/Add layer action. Do not remove pre-existing layers, edit saved records or change filter values. The unchanged-layer assertion must be evidenced by visible before/after layer-list states, not an inferred backend claim."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
